-semibold text-foreground","children":"该进哪个很清楚"}]}],["$","$1","17",{"children":"：同样每月 800G，本店年付 ¥1500，CTC-02 只要 ¥600，"}],["$","$1","18",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"本店贵 2.5 倍"}]}],["$","$1","19",{"children":"，而且本店公告停在 2024 年底。"}],["$","$1","20",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"优惠码是公开的"}]}],["$","$1","21",{"children":"："}],["$","$1","22",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"10%OFF"}]}],["$","$1","23",{"children":"，九折、任意套餐，被做成一张标价 ¥99999 的假套餐卡挂在商店里。"}],["$","$1","24",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"压长周期基本没用"}]}],["$","$1","25",{"children":"：季付=月付×3、半年=月付×6、两年=年付×2、三年=年付×3，全部零折扣，只有「半年→年」这一跳真降价。"}],["$","$1","26",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"三个硬门槛"}]}],["$","$1","27",{"children":"：两站国内都被 DNS 污染、"}],["$","$1","28",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"必须先有代理才进得去"}]}],["$","$1","29",{"children":"；注册"}],["$","$1","30",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"强制填邀请码"}]}],["$","$1","31",{"children":"；每档明写"}],["$","$1","32",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"不支持退款"}]}],["$","$1","33",{"children":"。速度与流媒体解锁本站未实测。"}]]}],"\n"]}]
